#: plinius-boot:8212 plinius-boot:8228
msgid "Put back"
msgstr "Restaurer"

#: plinius-boot:8216
msgid "Partition table from before the places on the phone"
msgstr "Table des partitions d’avant les places sur le téléphone"

#: plinius-boot:8222
msgid "Putting the partition table back"
msgstr "Restauration de la table des partitions"

#: plinius-boot:8224
msgid "The partition table is back"
msgstr "La table des partitions est restaurée"

#: plinius-boot:8225
msgid "Volla OS will be formatted when you write the original back."
msgstr "Volla OS sera formaté lorsque vous réécrirez l’original."

#: plinius-boot:8226
msgid "Put the partition table back?"
msgstr "Restaurer la table des partitions ?"

#: plinius-boot:8227
msgid ""
"The places on the phone and the systems on them are gone afterwards, and "
"Volla OS is formatted once more."
msgstr ""
"Les places sur le téléphone et les systèmes qu’elles contiennent "
"disparaissent ensuite, et Volla OS est formaté une fois de plus."

#: plinius-boot:8233
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Kept in {dir}"
msgstr "Conservé dans {dir}"

#: plinius-boot:8235
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Finished swap, kept in {dir}"
msgstr "Échange terminé, conservé dans {dir}"

#: plinius-boot:8265 plinius-boot:8536 plinius-boot:9511
msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "Annulé"

#: plinius-boot:8266
msgid ""
"The boot menu still shows what it showed before. The partition that was "
"being written may be incomplete, and a copy on this PC stays."
msgstr ""
"Le menu de démarrage affiche toujours la même chose qu’avant. La partition "
