msgid ""
"{error}\n"
"\n"
"The boot menu changes only as the last step, so it still shows what it "
"showed before."
msgstr ""
"{error}\n"
"\n"
"Le menu de démarrage ne change qu’à la dernière étape : il affiche donc "
"toujours ce qu’il affichait avant."

